            "notes": "## \ud83d\udcaa powers\n[Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) is the best for charging Valk early and often, which is exactly what we want for max [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da) gameplay.\n\n\n## \ud83d\udcb0 items\ni *always* go [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) in 100% of my games for Round 1. in my experience, this is the most reliable and balanced start. however, pick your poison: if you're a  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) enjoyer don't let me stop you!\n\nthere's also an argument to be made for [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) since we DO want Valk as much as humanly possible, however it's not my personal choice since you have to die to get value out of it, which will rob us of that sweet sweet MVP bonus cash and give it to the enemy team. not ideal.\n\n## \u2753 how it works\nswitch staff targets often to maintain [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) buff. our main goal for Round 1 is to score MVP by getting the most cash\u2014we do that by healing absurd amounts between all our teammates and by dying the least. play cover, use your in-game pings, and *play with your team* just like in normal modes.\n\n**important to note:** [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) works for both yellow and blue beam, so make sure you're damage boosting multiple targets during downtime from healing.\n\nif someone on your team is begging for a pocket you can usually ignore them unless they're [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546) or [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) but you may have to stick to your tank a lot if your other support is a [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768) or [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317). but you'll get the MOST value out of this build by flying around your whole team like the magical healing fairy you are \ud83e\uddda",
