            "notes": "## \ud83d\udcb0 items\nkeep your greens from Round 1. [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) gives great value with its CDR and only has 5% less WP than [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) so prioritize it if you can. [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) for the movement speed which will help with survivability.\n\nif you don't have the cash, sell [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf). [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) more than makes up for its loss and this early, WP from [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) is better than attack speed in my opinion.\n\nif you did really well in Round 1 and are now uber rich (~16-18k cash) keep your greens and buy [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) instead of [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054), especially if your other support is a [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768) or [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317). this will snowball your healing potential early, leading to more MVPs and of course, more bonus cash.\n\nif you're feeling *really* brave and your dps are popping off keep your greens and take [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca). this option is the highest risk highest reward. we'll build [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) later but getting it now is huge if you think you can pull it off.\n\n## \u2753 how it works\nexactly the same as Round 1, just more. keep farming cash by healing and blue beaming when able, rotate your staff targets very often and try your best not to die!",
