            "notes": "## \ud83d\udcaa powers\n[Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) gives us a mini-Valk every time we get off a rez. this mini-Valk gets the [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) buff, which means we can whip out the blaster for more cash and more ult charge.\n\n## \ud83d\udcb0 items\nalways prioritize [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) once you have [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591), these two synergize perfectly. easier rez means more [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) procs, which means mini-Valks from [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) which we can use to farm Valk.\n\notherwise, same as Round 4.",
