            "created_at": "2025-08-24T06:18:53.276562+00:00",
            "notes": "## \ud83d\udcb0 items\nby this point, you should sell [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) in favor of one of several Epic survival items. my go-to is  [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) for the armor and stacking damage reduction, however there are some nice alternatives depending on your personal preference and situation:\n\n[Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) CDR and passive are nice QoL. pairs especially well with [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) if you chose to go the left shift spam route\n\n[Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) is really nice for extra mobility, which is helpful if there is an enemy [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) or [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424) giving us problems\n\nwhatever your choice, make sure you have at least one!",
